      "snippet": {
        "line": 560,
        "text": "familyProjection F z := projection (familyP1 F z) (familyP2 F z) (familyA F z) (familyB F z), with familyP1 = x·Q_s/L and familyP2 = x·N_s/(L·E), so familyProjection = (x/L)(Q_s + b N_s/(aE))"
      }
